   "title": "How this works",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Align the board with an approved shot\nTrace an accepted opening frame into a monochrome planning drawing. This preserves the performed cast and prop state. Before any frame is approved, workflow 14 still plans independent compositions from text.\n\nAI mode: Normal uses Gemma 4 12B at 8-bit; Fast uses E4B. Change the Open Cinema Writer mode widget. Image and video models stay the same. Cast-review findings retain the saved candidate; inspect it before using it downstream."
   ],
